# ─── Raw Data ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DLD CSV exports are large (multi-MB) government open data files that
# anyone can re-download from https://dubailand.gov.ae. Storing them in
# Git would bloat the repo without adding reproducibility value.
*.csv
*.xlsx

# ─── Power BI ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .pbix files are large binaries that Git can't diff or merge. The
# dashboard is showcased via screenshots in docs/images/ and the
# semantic model lives in Microsoft Fabric (not in this repo).
*.pbix

# ─── Credentials & Environment ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Snowflake passwords, API tokens, and connection strings must never
# appear in version control. Use environment variables instead.
.env
*.env
.env.*

# ─── Python ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Virtual environments, bytecode caches, and Jupyter checkpoints are
# local development artifacts — not project source code.
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ─── OS & IDE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# macOS Finder metadata and IDE-specific config files are machine-local
# and should not propagate across clones.
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
